{"summary":"Find the answers of town mystery in the game with escape the room mechanics","description":"You are a private detective. After receiving a letter from your father, asking for help, you go to the small town of Redcliff.\nThe city is completely empty. Where have all the inhabitants gone? What happened to your father?\nThis is what you have to find out. Explore the city, find clues, solve puzzles, open locks to advance your investigation. The game is a mixture of escape the room and classic quests.\n\nFeatures:\n- Fully 3D levels that can and should be rotated to inspect them from another angle.\n- Variety of locations from the usual residential building to the ancient catacombs.\n- Interactive world\n- Many puzzles\n- Detective story, with unexpected plot twists.\n\nGame earned multiple Awards.","esrbNotes":"Mild Fantasy Violence, Tobacco Reference","pegiNotes":"Fear","iapPrices":"$1.99 - $40.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/c9ZgINOmmj8?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/WU13sj08mAzGZcArd9wR8S9CE4-yt7e63Wtwxm-B3z_GtCH5R8juFWYnkKS5vZrJx0E1wg48-D5WTxyb7-Bphg","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/J9Je3Y2xJy3hPtyGYy_5uAOCe6mlT37Mufo5nd0sVnzz2ay5TEsTBhre7nDe_OR8e7YHxbc5K_siW2iZgH0QEA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/XcB5HM0VT6tUu3X6PhBitJkFitsfHMMHjfMMrbAqVQ8WYXU-wBOsOFXdw73gk65xCqsMh6AatiY7uNzdxwnR","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8quCG5PDLHkwcPJ4W_2NzrQsw-3pWjiaEo8KNAeiBmahUZ_tiUjJw0QgIfYVOQ0DuKu1YJDQZYdHlAcqnUlrTw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/j4YIijZThGaSi-J8efGIrKMTEIOLkjRA8qfqIuTdP1JtX4Cl4pCwUb_o50Wv2SnM3p6AqYsScRvYeOTHEIy7","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/QqQYxzceJLnYzLn1R-sLody_IhzbTIsowMAw8PBW835rh_-27l5xvMCblHGrrWY3QaqqQnpmmaHjhk7MkHbv","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/C1k3Uf0EtG-7IKDNBoy-7DMeiRu5qFFo4K69DWyiX0XWFoi9XXkQQSKQLCehY6al7iHTnhO-al8eT4CaNzgaM9E","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mnMZ1K1g5C47haviVx5WLe6NTOYWXBi9EEi